north_quay` | `within` north\\_quay |\n| `skiff` (on the border) | [vessel](../blocks/2-craft/vessel.mdx) | – | `draught` 1m |\n| `tug_one` | [tug](../blocks/2-craft/tug.mdx) | – | – |\n\n## Links\n\n| from | carries | to | fields |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `skiff` | `moors at` | `berth_a` | – |\n| `skiff` | `moors at` | `berth_b` | – |\n| `tug_one` | `guides` | `skiff` | – |\n\n## Border\n\nThe parts on the border of the document: `skiff`.\n\n## Marked places\n\nNone: no value of this document is marked for a search.\n\n",
